# Test-only profile for Core 0.4 Stage A0.3 (LABS-1.002): a predicate with a composite functional slot, a subtype
# that inherits it, and a subtype of located-at that will declare its own slot. Throwaway databases only.
define
entity seat sub place;
entity guest sub physical-object;
relation seat-assignment sub proposition, relates venue, relates seat, relates occupant;
relation vip-assignment sub seat-assignment;
relation berthed-at sub located-at;
place plays seat-assignment:venue;
seat plays seat-assignment:seat;
physical-object plays seat-assignment:occupant;
